'''Jeanne''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]] grants increased health and damage, farther [[Long Distance]], [[Colossus Slayer]], and [[Immune to Freeze|Immunity to Freeze]] and [[Immune to Explosions|Explosions]].

